"不是到手工资，也不一定等于本月税前工资。按工资单或随申办中显示的社保缴费基数填写。上海 2026 社保年度基数范围为 7,546～37,731 元。" = "This is not take-home pay and may differ from this month's gross salary. Use the contribution base shown on your payslip or in the Suishenban app. Shanghai's 2026 base range is CNY 7,546–37,731.";
