"按工资单或上海公积金账户显示的缴存基数填写。它可能与社保缴费基数不同。上海 2026 年度缴存基数范围为 2,740～37,731 元。" = "Use the contribution base shown on your payslip or Shanghai Housing Fund account. It may differ from the social insurance base. Shanghai's 2026 range is CNY 2,740–37,731.";
"公积金基数" = "Housing Fund Base";
"公积金个人比例" = "Employee Housing Fund Rate";
"预计个人社保 + 公积金" = "Estimated Employee Contributions";
"专项附加扣除（元/月）" = "Additional Deductions (CNY/month)";
"专项附加扣除怎么填？" = "How should I enter additional deductions?";
"填写个人所得税专项附加扣除的月度合计，例如子女教育、继续教育、住房贷款利息、住房租金、赡养老人等。没有符合条件的扣除项目就填 0。这里填的是税前扣除额，不是实际报销金额。" = "Enter the monthly total of eligible individual income tax deductions, such as children's education, continuing education, mortgage interest, rent or support for elderly dependants. Enter 0 if none apply. This is a pre-tax deduction, not a reimbursement amount.";
"没有符合条件的项目就填 0；不确定时可先填 0" = "Enter 0 if no eligible deductions apply; use 0 if unsure.";
"预计税后月薪" = "Estimated Net Monthly Salary";
"含社保、公积金个人缴纳扣除" = "After employee social insurance and housing fund contributions";
"预计月度个税" = "Estimated Monthly Income Tax";
"上海职工社保个人比例默认 10.5%（养老 8% + 医疗 2% + 失业 0.5%），公积金默认 7%，均可修改。社保和公积金基数分别填写，按本人实际申报基数为准；上海 2026 社保基数为 7,546～37,731 元，公积金基数为 2,740～37,731 元。专项附加扣除填写你实际享受的月度扣除合计。个税按全年 12 个月工资相同估算，实际金额会受累计预扣、年终奖及其他扣除影响。" = "Default employee social insurance contributions in Shanghai are 10.5% (8% pension, 2% medical and 0.5% unemployment); the default housing fund rate is 7%. Both are editable. Enter the actual declared bases separately. Shanghai's 2026 social insurance base is CNY 7,546–37,731 and the housing fund base is CNY 2,740–37,731. Enter the monthly total of deductions you actually receive. Tax is estimated using 12 equal salary months; actual tax may differ due to cumulative withholding, bonuses and other deductions.";
"目标名称，例如：旅行 / 新电脑" = "Goal name, e.g. Trip / New Computer";
"删除目标" = "Delete Goal";
"开启后，今日收入、本周 / 本月累计、时薪和日薪均显示为遮罩；工作进度百分比仍正常显示。可通过挂件上的眼睛图标快速切换。" = "When enabled, today's earnings, weekly and monthly totals, hourly rate and daily rate are hidden. Work progress remains visible. Toggle this quickly using the eye icon on the widget.";
"启用后需要允许 macOS 通知权限。提醒每天在设定时间触发；修改工作时间不会自动改变提醒时间。若未收到通知，先点击“发送测试通知”检查权限和系统投递。" = "Allow notifications in macOS when prompted. The reminder is sent daily at the configured time. Changing working hours does not change the reminder time. If no notification arrives, use Send Test Notification to check permissions and delivery.";
"官方节假日和补班安排优先于每周规则；关闭节假日日历后，仅按上方星期设置计算。" = "Official public holidays and make-up workdays take precedence over the weekly schedule. When the holiday calendar is disabled, only the weekday settings above are used.";
"午休时段会从有效计薪时间中扣除" = "Lunch breaks are excluded from paid working time";
"开启后，挂件平时只显示今日收入和进度条。鼠标移入挂件会自动展开全部统计，移出后收起。点击挂件可以固定展开；展开状态下点击收起图标可恢复自动收起。" = "When enabled, the widget normally shows only today's earnings and progress bar. Hover to expand all statistics; move away to collapse. Click to pin it open, then use the collapse icon to restore automatic collapsing.";
"也可以直接点击桌面挂件顶部的锁形图标快速锁定或解锁。" = "You can also lock or unlock it using the lock icon at the top of the desktop widget.";
"日薪 = 月薪 ÷ 当月计薪工作日；时薪 = 日薪 ÷ 每日有效工时。本周和本月累计包含已完成工作日及今天的实时进度。午休不计薪。" = "Daily rate = monthly salary ÷ paid workdays this month. Hourly rate = daily rate ÷ effective working hours per day. Weekly and monthly totals include completed workdays and today's live progress. Lunch breaks are unpaid.";
